 similar, wait a few minutes before following these instructions to copy the log files so that there is enough time for long operations to get logged.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eDM the log files to the \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/g/bug-files\\\&quot;\\u003eLogs / Crash Dumps / Other Bug Files\\u003c/a\\u003e group. \\u003cstrong\\u003eInclude a link to the DM in your thread.\\u003c/strong\\u003e  This link is only viewable by Roblox employees.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:12,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:11,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2026-09-08T19:06:35.794Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:null,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:3441,\&quot;reads\&quot;:54783,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:54782,\&quot;score\&quot;:36001.8,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:24388,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;how-to-post-a-bug-report\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Roblox\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:null,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:16,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;link_counts\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/g/bug-files\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:false,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:5072},{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/cant-edit-games-randomly-getting-could-not-open-the-place-with-exception-unable-to-open-the-place/414929/24\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Can&#39;t edit games, randomly getting `Could not open the place \\\&quot;###\\\&qu