https://devforum.roblox.com/t/roblox-corepackage-causing-errors-on-client-side/4944575/2\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Roblox CorePackage causing errors on client side\&quot;,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:0}],\&quot;read\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_title\&quot;:\&quot;\&quot;,\&quot;bookmarked\&quot;:false,\&quot;actions_summary\&quot;:[{\&quot;id\&quot;:2,\&quot;count\&quot;:519}],\&quot;moderator\&quot;:true,\&quot;admin\&quot;:false,\&quot;staff\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_id\&quot;:1311,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;trust_level\&quot;:4,\&quot;deleted_at\&quot;:null,\&quot;user_deleted\&quot;:false,\&quot;edit_reason\&quot;:null,\&quot;can_view_edit_history\&quot;:false,\&quot;wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;post_url\&quot;:\&quot;/t/how-to-post-a-bug-report/24388/12\&quot;,\&quot;can_accept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_unaccept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_translate\&quot;:false,\&quot;is_translated\&quot;:false,\&quot;detected_language\&quot;:null},{\&quot;id\&quot;:1901539,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;Roblox\&quot;,\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;Roblox\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/roblox/{size}/4100645_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2020-01-24T22:19:03.344Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003ch2\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-1901539-how-to-get-dump-files-1\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-1901539-how-to-get-dump-files-1\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003eHow to Get Dump Files\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-1901539-note-2\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-1901539-note-2\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003eNOTE:\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cimg src=\\\&quot;/images/emoji/twitter/warning.png?v=14\\\&quot; title=\\\&quot;:warning:\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;emoji\\\&quot; alt=\\\&quot;:warning:\\\&quot; loading=\\\&quot;lazy\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;20\\\&quot;\\u003e These dump files may contain sensitive information, so it’s important they’re \\u003cstrong\\u003eNOT\\u003c/strong\\u003e posted publicly, send them to \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/g/bug-files\\\&quot;\\u003eLogs / Crash Dumps / Other Bug Files\\u003c/a\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-1901539-how-to-find-dumps-automatically-generated-on-crash-3\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-1901539-how-to-find-dumps-automatically-generated-on-crash-3\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003eHow to find dumps automatically generated on crash\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eCrashes are when you get a crash dialog/popup or the program closes on its own. If you get a white screen / spinning beachball cursor, this is NOT a crash! See the freezes/hangs section below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have Studio installed, you can open the logs folder via Help \\u0026gt; Open Logs Folder (the logs folder is the same between the player and Studio, so even if your issue is in-game, you can get to your in-game logs through this UI button in Studio). Otherwise, you will need to manually browse to the logs location:\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eWindows: \\u003ccode\\u003e%localappdata%/Roblox/logs\\u003c/code\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eMac: Open the terminal and run \\u003ccode\\u003eopen $TMPDIR\\u003c/code\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eSort by latest and take the most recent .dmp file.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003ch3\\u003e\\u003ca name=\\\&quot;p-1901539-how-to-generate-dump-files-for-freezeshangs-4\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;anchor\\\&quot; href=\\\&quot;#p-1901539-how-to-generate-dump-files-for-freezeshangs-4\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/a\\u003eHow to generate dump files for freezes/hangs\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf your problem is with Studio, FIRST, make sure all plugins are disabled from File \\u0026gt; Advanced \\u0026gt; Manage Plugins to verify the cause is Studio. Include in your bug report that you tested with all plugins disabled.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nWindows\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOpen the Task Manager with \\u003ccode\\u003eCtrl+Shift+Escape\\u003c/code\\u003e.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eFind RobloxStudio in either the Details (Windows 10) or Processes tab.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eRight click and select “Create dump file”.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eTake the .DMP file shown in the resulting popup dialog.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n\\u003cdetails\\u003e\\n\\u003csummary\\u003e\\nMac\\u003c/summary\\u003e\\n\\u003cul\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eOpen the Activity Monitor from within Applications \\u0026gt; Utilities.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eSelect Roblox / Roblox Studio.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eClick the action menu in the toolbar (Gear Dropdown) \\u0026gt; Sample Process.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003cli\\u003eTake the .txt file saved in the proceeding dialog.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n\\u003c/details\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eGenerate 3 or more dump files like this, each a few minutes apart.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003chr\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eOnce you have the dumps/samples from either of the above steps, they are too large to share on the forum. You will need to upload them to a file hosting service (e.g. Google Drive, Dropbox). Zipping and compressing these first will often make them a manageable size.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eDM the dump files to the \\u003ca href=\\\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/g/bug-files\\\&quot;\\u003eLogs / Crash Dumps / Other Bug Files\\u003c/a\\u003e group. \\u003cstrong\\u003eInclude a link to the DM in your thread.\\u003c/strong\\u003e This link is only viewable by Roblox employees.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:13,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:11,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2026-07-20T16:33:26.866Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:null,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:1200,\&quot;reads\&quot;:42114,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:42113,\&quot;score\&quot;:21397.2,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:24388,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;how-to-post-a-bug-report\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Roblox\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:null,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:15,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;link_counts\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/g/bug-files\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:false,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:1970},{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/massive-lag-when-selecting-first-part-in-a-server/508554/6\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Massive lag when selecting first part in a server\&quot;,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:66},{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/roblox-studio-freezing-up-insane-memory-usage/802517/44\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;ROBLOX Studio - Freezing up / insane memory usage\&quot;,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:38},{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/studio-crashes-suddenly-very-frequent/518717/2\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflec